# agent-workflow-graph has no required environment variables — the core
# engine and its test suite run entirely offline with no external services.
#
# If you wire a real LLM into one of your nodes (see examples/research_workflow.py
# for where a node's "LLM call" would go), set whatever credentials your
# provider needs here, e.g.:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
